{# Move response: the whole graph (morphed into #graph) plus an out-of-band update
   of the moved node's Position span. htmx matches the OOB by id — if the inspector
   is open for this node the span exists and morphs in place; otherwise there's no
   target and htmx silently drops it (no console error). Must be hx-swap-oob="morph"
   (idiomorph's extension throws on non-morph OOB styles), tag/id matching the span
   in _inspector.njk so its outerHTML morphs cleanly. #}
{% include "_graph.njk" %}
<span id="inspector-position-{{ node.id }}" hx-swap-oob="morph">{{ node.x }}, {{ node.y }}</span>
